  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crustaceans/BH_CC_Header.webp\" width=\"1125\" height=\"244\"></span></span></strong></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fisensehostility\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://storage.ko-fi.com/cdn/brandasset/kofi_bg_tag_white.png\" alt=\"在 ko-fi.com 請我喝杯咖啡\" width=\"341\" height=\"129\"></span></span></strong></a></span></h2><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crustaceans/BH_CC_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"121\"></span></span></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#333\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">《甲殼動物》是一個新增數種生物的 Mod。此 Mod 的目的是讓海洋感覺更加多樣化且充滿生機，同時保持範圍明確。與其加入許多不同種類的生物，甚至是大量海洋生物，它特別專注於甲殼動物這個類別。<br></span></span></span></h2><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crustaceans/BH_CC_Creatures.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"121\"></span></strong></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>螃蟹：</strong><br></span></h3><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2Fg2xn6.png\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong>龍蝦：</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#36f;font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/XAKpDDx.png\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#333;font-size:14px\">關於生物的更多資訊請查閱<a href=\"https://github.com/ISenseHostility/Crustaceans/wiki/Creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。<br></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crustaceans/BH_CC_Items.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"121\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#36f\">蟹螯</span></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/4uBx2Ae.png\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#333\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">關於物品的更多資訊請查閱<a href=\"https://github.com/ISenseHostility/Crustaceans/wiki/Items\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#333\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fHostility\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crustaceans/BH_CC_Promo.webp\" width=\"1125\" height=\"202\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">需要 GeckoLib</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
